    {
      "title": "Legendary Soldier - Liu Bei",
      "date": "2023-12-23 01:49:09",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5410576585136284614",
      "content": "[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44336394/7b6e3e481a7b94ddbe2c25903f0cbf9d3128f5c3.jpg[/img]\n--Character Introduction--\n\nCard name: Liu Bei\n\nFaction: Liu Beijun\n\nStandby value: 8\n\nNumber of cups obtained: 5500 cups\n\n\n--Character details--\n\nLevel attributes\n\ngrade\tattack\tblood volume\t\nRequired ontology\n\n1\t2\t14\t1\n2\t3\t17\t2\n3\t3\t22\t6\n4\t4\t25\t12\n5\t4\t30\t25\n\n\nAbility Introduction\n\n1. [Call to the World 1] (Level 1 takes effect): Before each round of movement, summon a 4/2 cavalry guard within one square around oneself.\n\n[Command World 2 ] (effective at level 4): Summon one 5/3 cavalry guard within one grid around oneself before each round of movement.\n\n2. [Emperor's Art] (effective at level 1): When appearing, set the standby value of all legendary and elite soldiers in the hand to -2\n\n--Role analysis--\n\nCharacter rating: Five stars (worth obtaining and highly versatile)\n\nCharacter review: A must-have for stacking strength cards in the mid to late game, which can not only accelerate the summoning time of other legendary soldiers, but also continuously summon cavalry guards to suppress enemy soldiers. He is a legendary warrior worth cultivating in the later period.",
      "key": "2491360::2297fb3c9db627b0d5d7fb2488e66a11e394076a",
      "tags": null
    },
    {
      "title": "12-19 Update English language pack",
      "date": "2023-12-19 01:45:04",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5409450219989829903",
      "content": "The game now supports English, which can be switched through the \"Settings\" in the game.",
